      "title": "HERITAGE UNIVERSITY FACULTY HANDBOOK",
      "description": "HERITAGE UNIVERSITY FACULTY HANDBOOK \n \n \n \n \n \n \nFACULTY HANDBOOK \n \n \n \n \nAdopted by Faculty Senate on May 5 and Board of Directors on June 12, 1997 . Revisions made as per Section 2.13, \nMay 2011 and adopted by Board of Directors on June 17, 2011. Updated by Faculty Senate November 1,  2012. \nUpdated by Faculty Senate May 14, 2013. Updated by Faculty Senate March 25, 2014.  Updated by Faculty Senate \nMarch 18, 2015. Updated by Faculty Senate September 22, 2015. Updated by Faculty Senate February 7, 2017. \nUpdated by Faculty Senate April 4, 2018. Minor edits/corrections June 27, 2018. Minor edits/corrections March 6, \n2019. Updated by Faculty Senate December 5, 2019. Updated by Faculty Senate and approved by AAA April 7, \n2020. Updated by Faculty Senate February 17, 2021, approved by AAA March 4, 2021, and Cabi net September 8, \n2021. Updated by Faculty Senate and Cabinet, April 2022. Updated by Faculty Senate, approved by AAA April \n2023. Updated by Faculty Senate, approved by AAA October 2023. Updated by Faculty Senate, approved by AAA \nDecember 2024. Updated by Faculty Senate, approved by VPAA February 2026. Updated by Faculty Senate, \napproved by VPAA March 2026. Updated by Faculty Senate, approved by VPAA May 2026. Minor \nedits/corrections June 2026.  \n \n\nHERITAGE UNIVERSITY FACULTY HANDBOOK \nTable of Contents \n1 Section I ................................................................................................................................... 1 \n1.0 Preamble to Heritage University Faculty Handbook ...................................................... 1 \n1.1 Governance Structure...................................................................................................... 1 \n1.1.1 President’s Council ................................................................................................... 1 \n1.1.2 Institutional Planning Committee ..................................................